          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "7. The said aspect has been taken note of by this Court by order dated 01.04.2021 passed in the case of Manish Gupta Vs. State of M.P. in M.Cr.C. No.11462/2021 (Gwalior Bench) and has held as under:-\n\"In the present case, it is not the case"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "78f93ef2651847e39ba87dd2387f55e1_15",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
