        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is not the case of the applicant that he had already displayed in his shop that adulterated or substandard milk is sold."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "8b32e4180fcd47d4bc8143de78e2b852_17",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is the defence of the applicant that the milk was not kept for the purpose of sale but it was a sapreta after manufacturing of milk products."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3a761ec7001f46b1be1bbcac8eb4bf90_18",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "According to the FIR, he is running a Milk Dairy."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f9471273778e413b869637bd5d0831bf_19",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nThe applicant has not produced any licence to show that he is competent to produce any milk product."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "535ea0f8d4f84e8bb0d9d1b4c11ddf94_20",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Further, it would be a defence of the applicant that the sample which has been collected, was not a milk but it was a sapreta and it was not meant for sale."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "cf8524ebbe004719a40cf7b1e6458ee7_21",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Further, the applicant has not clarified as to why he had kept the sapreta in his shop, specifically when according to him, the same was not meant for sale."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "86b70f668a2c42db9bf2e2e77471d771_22",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Further, it is not the case of the prosecution as well the applicant that it was displayed by the applicant that the so-called milk/sapreta was not meant for sale."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a4276cf29e7d4cdb877c71fad1394fd0_23",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Selling any adulterated or substandard product to the innocent customers by projecting that the said product is a pure and safe for human consumption, would certainly be an offence under Section 420 of IPC."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "cff04c695353495e97cdf2fe4166b16f_24",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nSo far as the offence under Section 272 of IPC is concerned, the defence of the applicant that the milk was not kept for sale, cannot be accepted at this stage."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f801eb5f24994cf686d112c2932843de_25",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "If the milk/sapreta was not meant for sale, then he should not have kept the same in the shop and should have kept somewhere else or should have destroyed."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2d9dc116749c4ea4b5eb1fef7569c0ce_26",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Prima facie, it Rohit Jain vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 23 February, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/97602022/\n2 is clear that the sample of milk which has been collected by the Officer, was meant for sale, and it was "
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "ed0ea1fae2d74e32876a438f9bfb8f1a_27",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nSo far as the contention of the Counsel for the applicant that since the Act, 2006 is a complete Act in itself which provides for separate procedure for penalty is concerned,\nthe Counsel for the applicant could not point out any provision "
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a13c8732a2914a5d8c1dcdbd4690d228_28",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nThe Act, 2006 merely provides for penalties for contravening the provisions of the Act, 2006, whereas the offence under Sections 420 and 272 of IPC are different from the provisions of the Act, 2006."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "8d4ad918f45c4f7d875514be5f775340_29",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In absence of any bar under the Act, 2006, this Court is of the considered opinion that the Police is well within its right to resort to the provisions of IPC."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "567468f206834ef99a1825e37cce2309_30",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nThe Supreme Court in the case of State of Madhya Pradesh vs. Rameshwar and Others, reported in (2009) 11 SCC 424 has held as under:-\n''48."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "88f85c4bbfda4276a5853220e606c718_32",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "49. The judgments referred to by Mr. Tankha regarding the tendency to convert civil disputes into criminal cases to pressurize the accused, are unimpeachable, but the same will not apply to the facts of this case where a conspiracy to cheat"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "06f64cb4ad6c457fb71ae7e43209eda3_33",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Where the innocent consumers are being cheated by selling adulterated or substandard or unfit eatables, then this Court is of the considered opinion that the prosecution of the applicant for offence under Sections 420 and 272 of IPC is perm"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "cb95f980c7c0431a9fdc2423870da74c_34",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is not the case of the applicant that he has already been punished under the Act, 2006."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "66e8554c25874b86bf91a1565e665a7f_35",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Thus, the bar as contained under Section 26 of General Clauses Act would not apply."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "1be44fc4cce24a709eb1081e683e03ca_36",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nConsidering the totality of the facts and circumstances of the case, this Court is of the considered opinion that no case is made out for quashing the FIR in Crime No.13/2021 registered at Police Station Bairad, District Shivpuri for offen"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "23eca00c2fe74c44b3f5550b809b44e7_37",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Accordingly, the application fails and is hereby dismissed.\"\n8."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "39de720fb53a4ce7b678104eb8f1d145_38",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In the considered opinion of this Court, the present case is duly covered by the order passed by this Court in the case of Manish Gupta (supra)."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "98c87fc6a3ba41f1b8f13df1f3591361_39",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "9. Accordingly, the application fails and is hereby dismissed."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9d8c84159264450fa980bc189d3de661_41",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Interim order dated 02.11.2023 is hereby vacated."
      }
